  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "ac0afbbc-dcf3-4814-9f06-9a3c48f59abd",
      "question": "Which product categories missed their Q3 2026 net sales target in the merchandising plan, and by what percentage?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:37:16.217958Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:37:21.494740Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Three product categories missed their Q3 2026 net sales targets in the merchandising plan:\n\n| Category | Target Net Sales | Actual Net Sales | Shortfall (USD) | % Missed |\n|----------|------------------|------------------|-----------------|----------|\n| Electronics | $52,000 | $47,732.90 | $4,267.10 | 8.21% |\n| Kitchen & Dining | $36,000 | $33,670.35 | $2,329.65 | 6.47% |\n| Apparel | $11,800 | $11,362.97 | $437.03 | 3.70% |\n\nElectronics had the largest miss both in absolute dollars ($4.3K) and percentage (8.21%). The other four categories in the plan (Furniture, Home Decor, Bedding & Bath, Outdoor & Garden) met or exceeded their Q3 targets.",
        "citations": []
      },
